stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Validate
    Validate --> Continue: Diagnostic
    Validate --> Reject: Client
    Validate --> Complete: Business
    Validate --> Retry: Transient
    Validate --> Quarantine: Permanent
    Validate --> SecurityHold: Security
    Retry --> Validate: bounded retry, same logical bytes
    Retry --> Quarantine: attempts exhausted
    SecurityHold --> AuditAlert: safe audit and bounded alert
    Quarantine --> Replay: approved replay
    Replay --> Duplicate: completed Inbox, same EventId
    Replay --> Validate: incomplete Inbox, same EventId
    Quarantine --> Reprocess: separately approved request
    Reprocess --> Validate: new RequestId, original EventId unchanged
    Continue --> [*]
    Reject --> [*]
    Complete --> [*]
    Duplicate --> [*]
    AuditAlert --> [*]
